cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "falsify-giskard: PRML pre-registration adapter for Giskard scenario results"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that wraps the Giskard evaluation framework with
  Pre-Registered ML Manifest (PRML) v0.1 hashing, allowing an evaluation
  claim to be committed before a scenario runs and the scenario result to
  be verified against the committed manifest afterwards.
